      "note": "A calendar notice, not a finding about this code: Brakeman starts reporting sixty days before a release line leaves support, and Rails 8.0 leaves it on 2026-11-07. Rails 8.0.5.1 is patched and supported today. Ignored on 2026-10-12 so that an unrelated feature branch is not the place a framework upgrade happens; the fix is moving to Rails 8.1 on a branch of its own, before that date. This entry must be deleted by that upgrade, not carried through it. The fingerprint is tied to the version string, so a patch bump inside 8.0 brings the warning back, which is the intended reminder."
    },
